{"4097280": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Resonant Q", "steam_appid": 4097280, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097280/extras/242dfeea705b5266df7fc2b1221ebf7a.poster.avif?t=1779968875\" width=1030 height=8192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097280/extras/242dfeea705b5266df7fc2b1221ebf7a.webm?t=1779968875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097280/extras/242dfeea705b5266df7fc2b1221ebf7a.mp4?t=1779968875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097280/extras/d309427ae043b57aa83433b2d337a0e7.avif?t=1779968875\" width=1560 height=2132 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >/////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔹 About This Game </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resonant Q is a <strong>third-person action horror survival game</strong> designed for both <strong>solo and co-op play (1–3 players)</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set on a collapsing <strong>Orbital Ring megastructure above a ruined Earth</strong>, players take on the role of elite warriors know as Volts — pushing into hostile, anomaly-infested sectors in high-risk extraction runs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlike traditional survival shooters, <strong>Energy </strong>is your <strong>single, unified resource necessary </strong>for progress through the megastructure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy powers:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Anomaly scanning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental machinery</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Elevators and locked doors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life-support systems</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision is a trade-off.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend Energy to scan the darkness for what’s stalking you.<br>Burn it in combat.<br>Or conserve it to ensure you can extract before systems fail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resonant Q blends:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deliberate third-person shooter combat</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tense survival-horror exploration</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risk-reward extraction gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Co-op resource management</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Base building and crafting progression</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each run up the Orbital Ring pushes deeper into sectors filled with biomechanical horrors, environmental hazards, and evolving threats. The loot you recover can be brought back to the Slums — your persistent base — where you can craft, repair, upgrade, and expand your operational capabilities.<br>Upgrading your suit allows it to store more Energy means you can survive longer in orbit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether playing solo or in co-op, survival depends on discipline, and mastery of your Energy economy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔹 Key Features </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1–3 Player Online Co-op</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-Person Action Shooter Combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmic Horror Atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energy-Based Survival Mechanics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Extraction-Style Run Structure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orbital Ring Sci-Fi Setting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Base Building &amp; Crafting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Risk vs Reward Progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical Resource Management</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric Sci-Fi Horror</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔹 Summary</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resonant Q is ideal for players who enjoy sci-fi survival games, co-op horror shooters, extraction-style progression, and tense third-person action experiences. If you like strategic resource management similar to oxygen systems in deep-space survival games — but integrated directly into combat and abilities — Resonant Q delivers a new approach to survival horror.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097280/extras/242dfeea705b5266df7fc2b1221ebf7a.poster.avif?t=1779968875\" width=1030 height=8192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097280/extras/242dfeea705b5266df7fc2b1221ebf7a.webm?t=1779968875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097280/extras/242dfeea705b5266df7fc2b1221ebf7a.mp4?t=1779968875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4097280/extras/d309427ae043b57aa83433b2d337a0e7.avif?t=1779968875\" width=1560 height=2132 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >/////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////////</p><h2 class=\"b